      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Down Syndrome is caused by Trisomy 21, resulting in 47 chromosomes in somatic cells.",
        "Uracil replaces Thymine in RNA molecules.",
        "Haemophilia and Colour Blindness are classic examples of Sex-Linked Recessive disorders."
